  "uuid": "6b320dd1-3201-42ba-bca3-2ed8be975cae",
  "is_folder": false,
  "content": {
    "_uid": "d1b791c5-fc60-316f-0f26-bee86b62c672",
    "body": [
      {
        "_uid": "adecd243-b7b8-e251-dfc9-32dc09853fac",
        "content": {
          "type": "doc",
          "content": [
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Over the past two decades, the Department of Paediatrics and Child Health has brought in numerous international research grants worth US$ 11 million. This year's grants are an outstanding achievement and notably record-breaking for AKU. Congratulations to Drs Zulfiqar Bhutta, Anita Zaidi and their vibrant research team who have set a pace that honours their enthusiasm and commitment.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "AKU President's Message",
                  "type": "text",
                  "marks": [
                    {
                      "type": "bold"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Congratulations to the team for a set of outstanding achievements!! This is recognition of the competence, quality and outcomes of the research undertaken by these teams at AKU. I hope researchers at AKU will take inspiration from these achievements and follow this excellent example.",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "We are proud of you",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "type": "paragraph",
              "content": [
                {
                  "text": "Firoz",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            }
          ]
        },
